    { "on": "start", "text": "Land earns a little power every 12 turns, but only while it connects to a healthy DC." },
    { "on": "bugSpawned", "text": "A land bug. It freezes the cell and, every 8 turns, spreads into a neighbor that is no stronger than it is. Cells stronger than the bug act as firewalls." },
